{"duration_api_ms":145884,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"45303648-b04d-41e6-8b18-7a425e8a48f2","total_cost_usd":0.209888,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16151,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":14528,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":9808},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16151,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":14528,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16151,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16151},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":14528,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":16151,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.209888,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":9808,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"The front is a one-parameter curve in flight-path angle at the corner D=3.385, b=1.2, cone=70. D is capped by heatshield mass fraction (margin 1.4e-4), b and cone are capped by the aero-surrogate hull and the geometry limit, and gamma is capped near -3.57 by max_g. The only trade-off found beyond gamma is cone slightly below 70: C-8e1547b9ec46 (cone 69.8) is non-dominated. Round 7 added only 1.8e-5 of hypervolume, so the remaining gain is small refinement.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-81e40e27ff03 (gamma -3.57) has max_g margin 4.7e-5, and C-112b974177e0 (gamma -3.572, D 3.38) violates max_g. Gamma is therefore capped near -3.5703.\",\"C-8e1547b9ec46 (cone 69.8, D 3.384, gamma -3.5) gives 273030 W/m2 and 391.79 K. Interpolating the cone-70 curve at -3.5 gives about 272890 and 391.91, so lower cone trades slightly more flux for slightly lower T.\",\"C-7799f09f0eed (b 1.1) is worse in both objectives than the b 1.2 curve, and hull failures at b 1.205-1.25 or cone 69.0 (C-166a3a760ccb, C-2375647d7e43) show b 1.2 and cone near 70 are the boundary.\",\"Mass margin: D 3.384 gives 7.4e-4 and D 3.385 gives 1.4e-4 (C-385f3798bd45, C-81e40e27ff03). The margin falls about 4e-4 per degree of cone reduction (from C-8e1547b9ec46), so cone below 69.8 needs D of about 3.384.\",\"g is nearly independent of geometry: 13.0 at gamma -4.2 (C-602600f85327) and 11.88 at -3.5 (C-8e1547b9ec46) give a slope of about 1.6 g/deg. There is no way to get lower T through steeper gamma.\"],\"mechanism\":\"This relies partly on prior Allen-Eggers-type scaling and partly on the data. Flux falls with nose radius and area, and T falls with a shorter heat pulse at steeper gamma. D, b and cone are pinned at their constraint corner, and gamma is pinned by g. The remaining freedoms are gamma along the curve and small cone reductions, which add a little drag-area and mass-margin trade. The cone-69.8 offset (about +0.05% flux, -0.12 K) gives non-dominated points spaced along the gamma range. Gamma gap-fillers at cone 70 raise coverage of the convex front. Cone probes at 69.2-69.7 test where the hull edge lies.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The hull edge in cone at b=1.2 is unknown, since cone 69.0 failed and 69.8 passed, so the cone 69.2-69.7 probes may fail. The cone offset effect at other gammas is inferred from one point. Predictions for gap-fillers are linear interpolation. Feasibility at gamma -3.5703 is marginal.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Push gamma to the g cap: g margin at -3.57 is 4.7e-5, and the estimated slope suggests -3.5703 is still feasible.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5703},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274640,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.08,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Extends the front end point by the last margin available.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Cone 69.8 at D 3.385, at the g cap, to test the low-T offset at the corner end.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":69.8},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":390.97,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Mass margin is about 6e-5, so this is near the limit but should be feasible.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Cone 69.9 at the g cap, an intermediate offset.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":69.9},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274630,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.03,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the cone-trade dimension at the extreme point.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-8e1547b9ec46\",\"rationale\":\"Probe the hull edge with cone 69.7 at known-valid D 3.384, gamma -3.5.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":69.7},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273100,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.7,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests whether the cone offset keeps giving lower T, and where the hull ends.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-8e1547b9ec46\",\"rationale\":\"Probe cone 69.5, same base.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":69.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273250,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.55,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Larger step to find the cone limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-8e1547b9ec46\",\"rationale\":\"Probe cone 69.2, same base.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":69.2},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Bracket the hull edge, since cone 69.0 failed at D 3.38.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Cone-69.8 offset at the shallow end of the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":69.8,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":227340,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.75,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks that the offset also helps at low gamma.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Cone-69.8 offset at gamma -2.0.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":69.8,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":237700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":409.86,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Adds a non-dominated candidate near the front's middle-left.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Cone-69.8 offset at gamma -2.5.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":69.8,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":249130,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":402.92,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Mid-front offset point.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Cone-69.8 offset at gamma -3.0.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":69.8,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":260900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":396.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Offset point with D 3.385, which is better than the earlier D 3.38 point at gamma -3.0.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Cone-69.8 offset at gamma -3.3.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":69.8,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.3},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":268220,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.66,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Offset point on the steeper part of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Cone-69.8 offset at gamma -3.45.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"cone_half_angle_deg\":69.8,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.45},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":271830,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Offset point near the g cap.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Gap filler on the cone-70 curve at gamma -1.6.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":229185,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":416.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front; the prediction is a linear interpolation.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Gap filler at gamma -1.8.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.8},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":233290,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":413.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Gap filler at gamma -2.2.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.2},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":242075,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":407.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Gap filler at gamma -2.6.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":251360,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":401.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Gap filler at gamma -2.8.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.8},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":256100,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":399.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Gap filler at gamma -3.1.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.1},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":263290,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Gap filler at gamma -3.25.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.25},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":266870,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Gap filler at gamma -3.45.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.45},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":271700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front near the g cap.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-81e40e27ff03\",\"rationale\":\"Gap filler at gamma -3.52, just below the g cap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.52},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273375,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.58,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front near the g cap.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":110528,"type":"result","duration_ms":145921,"uuid":"9ee30da3-a3f7-432d-a1b8-8f4e63d0b887","ttft_stream_ms":1228,"time_to_request_ms":34,"first_content_frame_ms":1229,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
